243
00:10:40,790 --> 00:10:42,368
So the problem is
our data continued

244
00:10:42,368 --> 00:10:44,910
to shift over because we didn't
use any of those dollar signs

245
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:46,570
to lock in where they're going.

246
00:10:46,570 --> 00:10:49,385
So I'm going to find
my blue, and I'm

247
00:10:49,385 --> 00:10:50,510
going to drag it back over.

248
00:10:50,510 --> 00:10:51,135
Find my purple.

249
00:10:51,135 --> 00:10:52,130
Drag it back over.

250
00:10:52,130 --> 00:10:59,330
And since I want to just be able
to drag my formula over instead

251
00:10:59,330 --> 00:11:00,830
of retyping it over
and over again,

252
00:11:00,830 --> 00:11:02,770
if I put my dollar
signs there, I

253
00:11:02,770 --> 00:11:09,370
should be able to
now drag my formula.

254
00:11:09,370 --> 00:11:12,350
And if I click on Night now,
